              "explanation": "solutions[2].composition[0].concentration: Source batch input: 0.5 g. Final preparation volume is not independently established; the unsupported g/L assertion is withdrawn, not replaced by an assumed one-liter concentration. This is the contribution specified for the receiving medium batch, not the mass for preparing an unspecified volume of stock. No final-medium volume, percentage basis, density or chemical grounding is inferred. Locator=components[0].items[6]; accessed=2026-10-08T13:22:46.432534+00:00; capture SHA256=61c69f48450ab6c5f9328553ae143b64eeb8b7aab88fa1e966e00a19317cf528.\n\nAdditional exact excerpt: \"Mix ingredients except NaHCO3, Trace vitamins, Na2S・9H2O and cysteine・HCl・H2O, and autoclave under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Filter--sterilize NaHCO3 as an 8% solution and Trace vitamins while gassing with N2. Separately autoclave Na2S・9H2O and cysteine・HCl・H2O as 5% solutions under a N2 atmosphere. Aseptically and anaerobically add NaHCO3 and Trace vitamins to the medium under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Prior to inoculation, add the sterile Na2S・9H2O and cysteine・HCl・H2O solutions, and adjust pH to 6.8.\"\nsolutions[2].composition[0].notes: The preparation uses the different Na2S spelling; the discrepancy remains unresolved. No final-medium volume, percentage basis, density or chemical grounding is inferred. Locator=comments[0].comment; accessed=2026-10-08T13:22:46.432534+00:00; capture SHA256=61c69f48450ab6c5f9328553ae143b64eeb8b7aab88fa1e966e00a19317cf528.",
