              {
                "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
                "notes": "molecular_formula 'Cl2Ni' -> 'Cl2Ni.2H2O'. The recorded value described the anhydrous salt while the label names a hydrate, understating the mass by 18 g/mol per water. Corrected because the label states 2 water(s) of hydration, and the recorded formula was byte-identical to the anhydrous parent CHEBI:34887's ChEBI formula ('Cl2Ni') — the mark of a value inherited from the parent rather than measured for this record. Water appended in ChEBI's own dot-separated notation.",
                "source": "MIM curation (#321)"
              },
              {
                "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
                "notes": "mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning* than CHEBI:34887 ('nickel dichloride') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 'hydrate', never under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record's own identifier are unchanged.",
                "source": "MIM curation (#342)"
              },
              {
                "evidence_type": "MANUAL_CURATION",
                "notes": "Preserve the local dihydrate identity. MediaDive981 explicitly names NiCl2 x2H2O; primary experimental literature establishes nickel chloride dihydrate. Its automatic CAS7718-54-9 belongs to the water-free parent and is not adopted. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-c/assessments-v2.json; owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/Nicl2_X_2_H2o.yaml. Primary source references: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/34887/; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=NiCl2%20x%202%20H2O&ontology=chebi,ncit&rows=100; https://bacmedia.dsmz.de/ingredients/981; https://ojs.uel.br/revistas/uel/index.php/semexatas/article/download/2681/2331/8885; https://journals.iucr.org/q/issues/1967/10/00/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support.",
