                "notes": "molecular_formula 'HO4P.2Na' -> '12H2O.HO4P.2Na'. The recorded value described the anhydrous salt while the label names a hydrate, understating the mass by 18 g/mol per water. Corrected because adopted verbatim from the mapped term CHEBI:91259 ('disodium hydrogenphosphate dodecahydrate'), which is the specific hydrate and already carries the water.",
