              {
                "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
                "notes": "molecular_formula '2Cl.Co' -> '2Cl.Co.2H2O'. The recorded value described the anhydrous salt while the label names a hydrate, understating the mass by 18 g/mol per water. Corrected because the label states 2 water(s) of hydration, and the recorded formula was byte-identical to the anhydrous parent CHEBI:35696's ChEBI formula ('2Cl.Co') — the mark of a value inherited from the parent rather than measured for this record. Water appended in ChEBI's own dot-separated notation.",
                "source": "MIM curation (#321)"
              },
              {
                "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
                "notes": "mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning* than CHEBI:35696 ('cobalt dichloride') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 'hydrate', never under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record's own identifier are unchanged.",
                "source": "MIM curation (#342)"
              },
              {
                "evidence_type": "MANUAL_CURATION",
                "notes": "MediaDive578 and five current source recipes name CoCl2·2H2O; publisher-deposited primary abstract reports single-crystal CoCl2·2H2O. Retain the local two-water identity, without selecting an unverified CAS lead. No exact eligible term was established by bounded queries. CHEBI35696 is the closest verified water-free parent; use NARROW_MATCH/broadMatch and retain exact local identity. Current2Cl.Co.2H2O matches the source-defined stoichiometry. Dry structure fields were removed in7b and remain absent. Computed PubChem is corroboration, not the sole experimental proof. Primary source references: https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1063/1.1726454; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/cid/129656378/property/Title,MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,CanonicalSMILES/JSON; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/35696/. Captures, exact input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner bytes withdraw inherited support.",
