                "review_reason": "The row exact-matches soy peptone to the broader FoodOn class vegetable protein, hydrolyzed. The source explicitly says there is no exact FoodOn term and selects CLOSE_MATCH; the positive report describes a close parent. The row therefore upgrades the reviewed scope to identity. The combined Soytone or Phytone catalog token also requires product-scope handling before any exact alias approval.",
